  python3 -B "$P" --vault "$B/provided/$c/vault" --now "$NOW" \
    --out-dir "$B/provided/$c/out" | tail -n 1
  jq -c '.items[]|{name,criterion,verdict,nomination_type,target_hint,confident}' \
    "$B/provided/$c/out/inbox-preview-_待处理.json"
done
```

逐字输出：

```text
本批 1 件 · 拿不准 1 件 · 建议删 0 件
{"name":"hash-NBSP.md","criterion":"C6_undecided","verdict":"拿不准","nomination_type":null,"target_hint":null,"confident":false}
本批 1 件 · 拿不准 1 件 · 建议删 0 件
{"name":"GPT4声明.md","criterion":"C6_undecided","verdict":"拿不准","nomination_type":null,"target_hint":null,"confident":false}
本批 1 件 · 拿不准 1 件 · 建议删 0 件
{"name":"DOI来源.md","criterion":"C6_undecided","verdict":"拿不准","nomination_type":null,"target_hint":null,"confident":false}
```

Unicode 同族与反向锚：

```sh
python3 -B "$P" --vault "$B/heading/vault" --now "$NOW" \
  --out-dir "$B/heading/out" >/dev/null
jq -r '.items[]|[.name,.criterion,.verdict,(.confident|tostring)]|@tsv' \
  "$B/heading/out/inbox-preview-_待处理.json"
```

```text
NBSP.md	C6_undecided	拿不准	false
EM.md	C6_undecided	拿不准	false
IDEOGRAPHIC.md	C6_undecided	拿不准	false
NNBSP.md	C6_undecided	拿不准	false
OGHAM.md	C6_undecided	拿不准	false
三空格NBSP.md	C6_undecided	拿不准	false
无分隔.md	C6_undecided	拿不准	false
TAB标题.md	C3_empty_or_skeleton	建议删	true
空格标题.md	C3_empty_or_skeleton	建议删	true
```

U+00A0/U+2003/U+3000/U+202F/U+1680 和 `#keep` 均不再被当作 ATX 标题；ASCII 空格、TAB 仍是合法标题边界。实现见 [inbox_preview.py:392](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:392)。

### 2. BLOCKER-2 模型版本声明：FAIL，新 BLOCKER

原始 `generator: 由 GPT-4 生成` 和门内常规 Gemini/Llama/generator-key 变体已进入 C6；但中文正则将 X 限制为 1–40 字符：

```python
_GEN_CLAIM_CN_RE = re.compile(r"由[^。；！？\n]{1,40}?生成", re.IGNORECASE)
```

位置：[inbox_preview.py:751](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:751)。

同族反例：

```yaml
---
note: 本文由 openai-gpt-oss-120b-finetune-canvas-learning-system-v2026-09-01 生成
---
```

其中 `由` 与 `生成` 之间 65 字符，键名不是 generator，`openai` 中的 `ai` 也不是独立词。真实 CLI：

```sh
python3 -B "$P" --vault "$B/adversarial/vault" --now "$NOW" \
  --out-dir "$B/adversarial/out" | tail -n 1
jq -c '.items[]|select(.name=="ADV-长模型名.md")|
  {name,criterion,verdict,confident,target_hint,nomination_type,uncertain_reason,basis}' \
  "$B/adversarial/out/inbox-preview-_待处理.json"
```

```text
本批 10 件 · 拿不准 4 件 · 建议删 6 件
{"name":"ADV-长模型名.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","confident":true,"target_hint":null,"nomination_type":null,"uncertain_reason":null,"basis":"剥离 frontmatter / HTML 注释后实质正文 0 字符（95 字节文件：标题 0 行、纯结构行 0 行、代码围栏 0 行、其余皆空行或注释）"}
```

英文同族也有结构缝隙：

```sh
jq -r '.items[]|select(.name=="ADV-英文冒号.md" or .name=="ADV-英文零宽.md")|
  [.name,.criterion,.verdict,(.confident|tostring)]|@tsv' \
  "$B/adversarial/out/inbox-preview-_待处理.json"
```

```text
ADV-英文冒号.md	C3_empty_or_skeleton	建议删	true
ADV-英文零宽.md	C3_empty_or_skeleton	建议删	true
```

对应 `Generated by: GPT-4` 与 `Generated by<U+200B>GPT-4`。这是 round-8 BLOCKER-2 的直接同族，不是另一个无关模型名枚举问题。

### 3. HIGH DOI 来源：FAIL，新 HIGH

常规 `Source: DOI:10.1000/xyz`、`identifier: 10.1145/...` 已进入 C6，且未冒充 C1；但重复 frontmatter 键会遮蔽后值：

```yaml
---
doi:
doi: 10.1000/hidden
---
```

根因是 `frontmatter_map()` 使用 `setdefault`，只保留首个同名键值：[inbox_preview.py:546](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/canvas-vault/.claude/skills/clear-inbox/scripts/inbox_preview.py:546)。URL/DOI 信号随后只扫描折叠后的 `fm.items()`。

真实 CLI 筛选输出：

```sh
jq -c '.items[]|select(
  .name=="ADV-重复DOI-C3.md" or
  .name=="ADV-重复DOI-C4.md" or
  .name=="ADV-重复URL.md"
)|{name,criterion,verdict,confident,exact_duplicate_of,uncertain_reason,basis}' \
  "$B/adversarial/out/inbox-preview-_待处理.json"
```

```text
{"name":"ADV-重复DOI-C3.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","confident":true,"exact_duplicate_of":null,"uncertain_reason":null,"basis":"剥离 frontmatter / HTML 注释后实质正文 0 字符（33 字节文件：标题 0 行、纯结构行 0 行、代码围栏 0 行、其余皆空行或注释）"}
{"name":"ADV-重复DOI-C4.md","criterion":"C4_exact_duplicate","verdict":"建议删","confident":true,"exact_duplicate_of":"节点/库内正本.md","uncertain_reason":null,"basis":"归一化正文与 节点/库内正本.md 逐字相等（sha256 相同）"}
{"name":"ADV-重复URL.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","confident":true,"exact_duplicate_of":null,"uncertain_reason":null,"basis":"剥离 frontmatter / HTML 注释后实质正文 0 字符（46 字节文件：标题 0 行、纯结构行 0 行、代码围栏 0 行、其余皆空行或注释）"}
```

URL 反例是：

```yaml
---
url:
url: https://example.test/hidden
---
```

把 URL/DOI 放在首个同名值，或改用不同键，对照均为 `C6 / 拿不准 / false`。因此这是“有来源材料被确定删除”，同时穿透 C3、C4 两个出口。

另有独立 HIGH：

```yaml
---
citation: ISBN 978-7-111-54742-6
---
```

```sh
jq -c '.items[]|select(.name=="ADV-ISBN.md")|
  {name,criterion,verdict,confident,basis}' \
  "$B/adversarial/out/inbox-preview-_待处理.json"
```

```text
{"name":"ADV-ISBN.md","criterion":"C3_empty_or_skeleton","verdict":"建议删","confident":true,"basis":"剥离 frontmatter / HTML 注释后实质正文 0 字符（41 字节文件：标题 0 行、纯结构行 0 行、代码围栏 0 行、其余皆空行或注释）"}
```

这直接证伪“其余来源声明一律摆上台面、永不静默销毁”的验收措辞。

