但 [runner:172–176](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/_bmad-output/审查/evidence-g56c/g56c_mutations.py:172) 只解析 `FAILED `，忽略 `ERROR `；[runner:221](/Users/Heishing/Desktop/canvas/canvas-learning-system/.claude/worktrees/card-v6-inbox/_bmad-output/审查/evidence-g56c/g56c_mutations.py:221) 只排除 rc 0/5，不要求 `rc == 1`。

